                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">他，叫徐嘉路，绍兴一中创新班学生。于他而言，这里的一切是陌生的、新奇的，也是惊喜的、温暖的。一起来听听他的一中“初体验”吧！</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal align=center><SPAN style="COLOR: blue; FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201906/2019060414360122.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">高中的学习是紧张的，但是有同甘共苦的同学一起学习，有经验丰富，尽心尽力的老师教导，我们觉得充实而有劲头！</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal align=center><SPAN style="COLOR: blue; FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201906/2019060414363668.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">首先，我要感谢我们的黄伟中老师，他是我们物理竞赛辅导老师。也是我们学校的物理金牌教练，他所带的团队，在第</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>21</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">届、</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>24</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">届、</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>27</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">届全国物理竞赛中均获团体优胜，两位学生进入浙江省队，吴宇恺同学获第十二届亚洲物理竞赛第一名，此成绩为自</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>1991</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">年绍兴一中宣佩琦同学获国际奥赛金牌后，绍兴大市迄今为止最好的成绩。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>2014</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">年再次承担物理竞赛教学，在第</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>32</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">、</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>33</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">、</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>34</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">、</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>35</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">届中获得团体优胜，其中，第</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>34</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">、</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>35</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">届获浙江赛区一等奖人数均为绍兴大市第一。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>2017</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">年，蔡格非同学以高二学生的身份跻身国家集训队，为绍兴大市第一人。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal align=center><SPAN style="COLOR: blue; FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201906/2019060414370584.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">黄老师是一个一心为学生着想的好老师。他的工作量非常大，既要教高一的物理竞赛，又要教我们的物理课及物理竞赛。但他将每一份工作都做得一丝不苟。他的班级管理，让每一个同学都能自觉地进入学习状态，相互竞争，共同努力。他对我们的教导没有华丽的辞藻，却字字警人。我们这学期的安排是每天上午上文化课，下午是竞赛课。竞赛课考试很频繁，但每次下午考的试卷，黄老师都会在晚上就改好，把成绩发在</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>QQ</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">群上，那常常是晚上十一、二点了。细微之处见真章，黄老师在黑板上作图是那么熟练，那么标准。他的解题比参考答案更完美。这背后，都是他无言的付出。他的认真影响着我们每一个学生。黄老师不仅在学习上对我们严格要求，生活上也对我们非常关心。傍晚的锻炼，就是黄老师提议的。黄老师思维敏捷，见解犀利，经验丰富，又非常有个性，我们都很喜欢他，也很崇敬他。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal align=center><SPAN style="COLOR: blue; FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201906/2019060414372652.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">进入高中，让我想不到的是，语文课成了同学们每天期待的课。那是因为我们的语文老师谢澹。她是高中语文特级教师，她把语文课上得是那么的生动而有趣！</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal align=center><SPAN style="COLOR: blue; FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201906/2019060414375067.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">入学以来，谢老师带领我们阅读《红楼梦》，将本来枯燥的经典名著阅读落实于理解，深化于运用，相当切实，相当深邃。谢老师布置的作业也是别具一格，做“红楼梦”题材的书签，发“红楼梦”的朋友圈，写评论“红楼梦”的作文等等。在完成这些极富创意的作业的过程中，深化了同学们对名著的理解，提升了同学们的阅读与写作能力。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal align=center><SPAN style="COLOR: blue; FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201906/2019060414383272.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">谢老师还专门把我们这些同学的朋友圈装订成了一本书，每人一本，这将成为永不褪色的珍贵回忆。谢老师对阅读的这种深化，有相当大的广度，唤醒和激发了我们的阅读兴趣与欲望。这对于提高我们的语文素养，有着显而易见的功效。相信在谢老师的教导下，我们的语文水平将会有一个飞跃。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal align=center><SPAN style="COLOR: blue; FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201906/2019060414392720.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">我们其他科目的老师也都是既有能力又有责任心的好老师。他们风格不一，却都在各自的学科上，体现出丰富的经验，极高的素养，良苦的用心。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal align=center><SPAN style="COLOR: blue; FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201906/2019060414394477.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">大家可能会问，你能适应住校生活吗？我想说，我似乎没有经历一个适应的过程，从第一天开始就觉得很习惯。寝室的条件很好，有空调，有两个卫生间，只要我们在寝室的时间都是有热水的。空调的遥控器是放在寝室里的，开学一段时间一直下雨，气温也低，我们晚上开空调，不仅温度适宜，而且一个晚上下来晾洗的衣服也干了。而且，每一个楼层还有一排投币吹风机，为学校的人性化设计点赞。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal align=center><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: blue; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201906/2019060414400837.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">一中食堂里的菜不但丰富，而且味道很好。比如早餐，有中式的馒头、面条、馄饨、饭团，也有西式的三明治。每一餐都能做到营养搭配，又让人吃得津津有味。我们还利用傍晚放学时间去操场上跑步锻炼身体，因为健康是学习的本钱，高中的学习是一场智力战，也是一场体力战，我们要成绩更要健康。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal align=center><SPAN style="COLOR: blue; FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201906/2019060414404202.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">在一中的三年，我们将努力奔跑，累并快乐着，一抬头就看到前方的理想。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">我庆幸我来了一中，我庆幸我遇到了好老师！我希望，今天我以学校为荣，明天学校以我为荣。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: right; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal align=right><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"><FONT face=Calibri>      </FONT></SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">撰稿：徐嘉路</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT face=Calibri> </FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
